Run Setup/Config
Run Examples/Graphics/Setup_Character_Mechanics
Run Examples/Graphics/Character_Animation_Controls
Run Examples/Graphics/Setup_Character_Input
Print (Input Focus)
Set_Var Adam_Direction 100
Set_Var Adam_Axis 100
Set_Var Adam_Stick 100
Set_Var Adam_Pad_Right 1
Call Character_Mechanics_Update
Print_Global Mechanics.Adam.Position_X
Input Set_Focus GUI
Call Character_Check_Focus
Call Adam_Read_Input
Call Eve_Read_Input
Call Character_Mechanics_Update
Print (Input Focus)
Print_Global Mechanics.Adam.Position_X
Print_Global Mechanics.Adam.Velocity_X
Print Var Adam_Direction
Print Var Adam_Stick
Print Var Adam_Pad_Right
Input Toggle_Focus
Call Character_Check_Focus
Call Adam_Read_Input
Call Character_Mechanics_Update
Print (Input Focus)
Print_Global Mechanics.Adam.Position_X
Input Close_Controller -1
Done
